    { "key": "credits.body", "value": "DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT\nBerat Sağır\n\nNARRATIVE FRAME\nAll characters and personal events are fictional. The historical context was checked against Hamburg city history sources, museum collections and educational material.\n\nART AND SOUND\nMade for this project in an archive paper, linocut and shadow theatre idiom. No photographs taken from the internet, no licensed music and no content from another game were used.\n\nDETAILED SOURCES\nSee Docs/HISTORICAL_NOTES.md inside the project." },

